* Stage 5 Test 5: J-only response. A RASSCF with Exact Emb Pot = J[P_B], no partner nuclei.
* Contexts: B source -> AB RICD (EXACTEMB) -> A context with injected RunFile.

&GATEWAY
Title=Stage 5 B source context
Coord
6
ethylene B at z 3.5
C  -0.6695   0.0000   3.5000
C   0.6695   0.0000   3.5000
